    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A clever take on the time-loop mechanic that will have you feeling brilliant one moment and clumsy the next.&quot;</i><strong> - Indie Game Buzz Editor</strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Record Rewind Repeat</strong> is a mind-bending puzzle-platformer that tests your timing, logic, and reflexes. Navigate 50 meticulously crafted levels where every move matters. Use a unique time-recording mechanic to create duplicates of yourself and work together across time to overcome intricate puzzles and platforming challenges.<br><br><strong>Story:</strong>\u00a0You answered an ad for a test subject for a Dr. Ty M. Wells, the ad was vague but promises a good reward upon completion or a temporal obstacle course, whatever that is.. You need the money so seems like a good opportunity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Time Manipulation Gameplay:</strong> Record your actions, rewind to the past, and collaborate with your time-duplicates to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 Handcrafted Levels:</strong> Each level introduces new mechanics and challenges, testing your logic, timing, and platforming precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple to Learn, Hard to Master:</strong> Intuitive controls make it accessible to all players, while the puzzles grow in complexity to keep you engaged.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalistic 3D Art Style:</strong> A clean, distraction-free visual aesthetic that highlights the puzzles and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For All Ages:</strong> Perfect for kids, adults, and anyone who loves puzzles and platformers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves, strategize your actions, and execute perfectly timed maneuvers to solve challenging puzzles and achieve success. Whether you're a casual player looking for a fun challenge or a puzzle enthusiast seeking your next obsession, <strong>Record Rewind Repeat</strong> offers an experience you won't forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master time and logic to conquer all 50 levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and start your time-manipulating journey!</strong></p>",
